CMPR-Mixer research code

This repository contains forecasting components adapted from TimeMixer:
https://github.com/kwuking/TimeMixer
TimeMixer: Decomposable Multiscale Mixing for Time Series Forecasting,
Shiyu Wang et al., ICLR 2024.
The original Apache License 2.0 text is retained in LICENSE.

Modified areas include the forecasting-only model path, fixed-capacity
prototype retrieval, exogenous gates/embeddings, mean-anchored pooling,
data loading, experiment entry points, and regression tests.

The local prototype implementation traces back to ProtoTS:
https://github.com/SKURA502/ProtoTS
Ziheng Peng et al., ProtoTS: Learning Hierarchical Prototypes for Explainable
Time Series Forecasting, ICLR 2026.
Its local snapshot does not contain a license. Confirm redistribution
permission before a public release. The TimeMixer license is not a grant
of rights to third-party material.

